hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1750","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dua kartey they: Main teri panaah maangta hun bakheeli aur susti se aur zaleel umr se aur qabr key azaab se aur Dajjaal key fitney se aur zindagi aur maut key fitney se. (Bukhari: 4707). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aulaad unki jiney ham ne Nuh key sath sawaar kya tha. Beshak wo shukr guzaar banda tha)."
